abstract: >
  Reproducible R + DuckDB pipeline that audits, ingests and analyses moral-damages (dano moral)
  awards in decisions of Brazil's Superior Court of Justice (STJ) published in the official gazette,
  using only official open data (STJ Open Data Portal, IBGE/SIDRA, CNJ). Work in progress.
